        "title": "Professional workers like doctors, nurses and teachers make a greater contribution to society and so should be paid more than sports and entertainment personalities. To what extent do you agree or disagree?",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>Professional workers like doctors, nurses and teachers make a greater contribution to society and so should be paid more than sports and entertainment personalities. To what extent do you agree or disagree?</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Professional salaries versus entertainment earnings <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZXCTdIwYfoEHiYxN02ilInbigxc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Professional salaries versus entertainment earnings cho 1 quan điểm:</strong> Những người l&agrave;m nghề chuy&ecirc;n m&ocirc;n như b&aacute;c sĩ, y t&aacute; v&agrave; gi&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n đ&oacute;ng g&oacute;p nhiều hơn cho x&atilde; hội v&agrave; do đ&oacute; n&ecirc;n được trả lương cao hơn những người nổi tiếng trong lĩnh vực thể thao v&agrave; giải tr&iacute;.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E3ZGdHNbvo7a5Xx13JCl7W0YgIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Bạn đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với &yacute; kiến n&agrave;y?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G2WQdS3ZBo0EqjxQ0E6lWFRcgag\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Professional salaries versus entertainment earnings v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F528dFEjBo6SNZxoRhwltZTugjE\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HmfndoSPQowoGTxD5NxlDXDHg8e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mn9bdR5NqoPxjfxpiRdlL4L3gXg\"><em>(*) Bạn học&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-to-what-extent\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">c&aacute;ch viết Introduction cho dạng To what extent </span></a></strong>ở đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;.</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KZH7dfmkgoHhTWxRag7lCbaHgPf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WxkxdSg0moGTKxxQC9ClmVX7gIe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>&nbsp;deserve higher salaries <em>(xứng đ&aacute;ng với mức lương cao hơn)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WxkxdSg0moGTKxxQC9ClmVX7gIe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Su3sdLNago28SKxnj8MlA1XOgmf\">essential service providers <em>(những người cung cấp c&aacute;c dịch vụ thiết yếu)</em></div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Su3sdLNago28SKxnj8MlA1XOgmf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">Bạn n&ecirc;n n&oacute;i r&otilde; quan điểm của m&igrave;nh l&agrave; đồng &yacute;, hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm '<strong>đồng &yacute;'</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng \"<strong>Mặc d&ugrave; c&aacute;c vận động vi&ecirc;n v&agrave; nghệ sĩ giải tr&iacute; c&oacute; những l&yacute; do ch&iacute;nh đ&aacute;ng cho mức thu nhập cao của họ, t&ocirc;i tin rằng những người cung cấp c&aacute;c dịch vụ thiết yếu n&ecirc;n được đền b&ugrave; hậu hĩnh hơn.\"</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MvJpdBfVJoVwjCxvq9qlilBMged\"><em>(*) Bạn t&igrave;m hiểu về bản chất của <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> ở b&agrave;i học thử n&agrave;y nh&eacute;: <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cach-lap-luan-4060\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic lập luận dạng 'To What Extent'</a></strong></span></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8hBdo0PeoqsShxLrO2lVfjLggg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận Partly Agree</strong> th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DJ7UdTfc8oo2WyxIphSljunsgDe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về một số l&yacute; do c&aacute;c vận động vi&ecirc;n v&agrave; nghệ sĩ giải tr&iacute; c&oacute; những l&yacute; do ch&iacute;nh đ&aacute;ng cho mức thu nhập cao.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vt2udEiR3otV1NxclTqllVpUgDc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng những người cung cấp c&aacute;c dịch vụ thiết yếu n&ecirc;n được đ&atilde;i ngộ hậu hĩnh hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về một số l&yacute; do một số l&yacute; do c&aacute;c vận động vi&ecirc;n v&agrave; nghệ sĩ giải tr&iacute; c&oacute; những l&yacute; do ch&iacute;nh đ&aacute;ng cho mức thu nhập cao.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, những người nổi tiếng trong thể thao v&agrave; giải tr&iacute; c&oacute;<em> </em>l&yacute; do ch&iacute;nh đ&aacute;ng cho mức thu nhập cao của họ tới một mức độ nhất định.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PpnQdgecGorUQ9xqsaulsoDkgNh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SSJRdsOQtoG7mJxddeXldVAIgyc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Một l&yacute; do l&agrave; v&igrave; họ thường c&oacute; sự nghiệp ngắn hơn nhiều so với c&aacute;c nghề kh&aacute;c, v&igrave; hầu hết vận động vi&ecirc;n v&agrave; nghệ sĩ <em>đạt đỉnh cao v&agrave;o độ tuổi 20 (reach their peak in their 20s)</em> hoặc đầu 30 v&agrave; phải đối mặt với những chấn thương kết th&uacute;c sự nghiệp <em>(face career-ending injuries)</em> hoặc suy giảm khả năng ngay sau đ&oacute;.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-INZedPXZIoDxdVx6GXIl6kCYgQb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Do đ&oacute;, họ cần kiếm được số tiền đ&aacute;ng kể trong những năm l&agrave;m việc hạn chế để <em>trang trải cuộc sống&nbsp;cho phần đời c&ograve;n lại (sustain themselves for the rest of their lives sustain themselves)</em>.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JSD9dGbNiorQORx8xSwlhZVLg5b\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YQygdQYwUom7iexF14hlO2dkgDd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Ngo&agrave;i ra, th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng trong những lĩnh vực n&agrave;y <em>đ&ograve;i hỏi những khả năng bẩm sinh hiếm c&oacute; (demand rare natural abilities)</em> kết hợp với nhiều năm r&egrave;n luyện nghi&ecirc;m khắc.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X4mDdsOcXoolKVx1QFjl4Ir2gyc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> V&igrave; chỉ c&oacute; <em>một phần rất nhỏ (a tiny fraction)</em> trong số những vận động vi&ecirc;n v&agrave; nghệ sĩ đầy tham vọng đạt được đẳng cấp h&agrave;ng đầu, <em>sự hiếm c&oacute; đặc biệt của họ (their exceptional rarity) </em>chứng minh cho mức th&ugrave; lao cao m&agrave; họ nhận được.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng những người cung cấp c&aacute;c dịch vụ thiết yếu n&ecirc;n được đ&atilde;i ngộ hậu hĩnh hơn.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin chắc rằng b&aacute;c sĩ, y t&aacute; v&agrave; gi&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n c&oacute; những đ&oacute;ng g&oacute;p quan trọng hơn nhiều, xứng đ&aacute;ng được trả lương cao hơn.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SFw6dSGEGoRcSSxYg3glmCgUgac\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WduxdLYRlouMz3x9cZYlxJxAgje\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: &nbsp;</strong>Lập luận thuyết phục nhất l&agrave; <em>c&aacute;c chuy&ecirc;n gia y tế (medical professionals)</em> trực tiếp cứu sống v&agrave; ngăn ngừa bệnh tật h&agrave;ng ng&agrave;y.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NwBjdg29WoaKIDxNhPGl7MGpgbd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>C&ocirc;ng việc của họ ngăn chặn sự mất m&aacute;t về t&iacute;nh mạng con người, v&agrave; đ&oacute;ng g&oacute;p n&agrave;y l&agrave; <em>kh&ocirc;ng thể thay thế v&agrave; cơ bản đối với x&atilde; hội (irreplaceable and fundamental to society)</em>, v&igrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; giải tr&iacute; n&agrave;o c&oacute; thể thay thế cho sức khỏe v&agrave; sự sống c&ograve;n.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SfNydu4h7oYzAYx4ZyVl57ZBgKf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YLs1dL1D7o7jbHxj8NElcItIgOB\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Hơn nữa, gi&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n đ&oacute;ng vai tr&ograve; quan trọng kh&ocirc;ng k&eacute;m khi gi&aacute;o dục những người trẻ tuổi - những người sẽ trở th&agrave;nh lực lượng lao động v&agrave; những nh&agrave; l&atilde;nh đạo tương lai.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWgmdHBiaoCL70xLVzHlqO01gYg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Chất lượng gi&aacute;o dục m&agrave; họ cung cấp <em>quyết định sự tiến bộ (determine society's progress and development)</em> v&agrave; ph&aacute;t triển của x&atilde; hội, v&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; gi&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n th&igrave; sẽ kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; bất kỳ nghề n&agrave;o kh&aacute;c, kể cả y học v&agrave; giải tr&iacute;, tồn tại ngay từ đầu.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MBiidSgyBoGG3yxZF4Bl60qlg2f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TcZnd99dmoDoeqx1VbLlL8Lhgve\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">sports and entertainment figures <em>(những người nổi tiếng trong thể thao v&agrave; giải tr&iacute;)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TcZnd99dmoDoeqx1VbLlL8Lhgve\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">&nbsp;deserve higher compensation <em>(xứng đ&aacute;ng được trả lương cao hơn)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2595,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>Opinions are divided on whether professional workers such as doctors, nurses and teachers deserve higher salaries than those in the sports and entertainment industries. Although I acknowledge that athletes and entertainers have valid reasons for their substantial earnings, I believe that essential service providers should be compensated more generously.</p>",
            "question_id": 24741,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2596,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>Admittedly, sports and entertainment personalities can justify their high incomes to a certain extent.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">First of all, one reason for this is that they typically have much shorter careers than other professionals, as most athletes and entertainers reach their peak in their 20s or early 30s and face career-ending injuries or declining abilities shortly after. Consequently, they need to earn substantial amounts during their limited working years to sustain themselves for the rest of their lives.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, success in these fields demands rare natural abilities combined with years of rigorous training. Since only a tiny fraction of aspiring athletes and performers ever reach the top level, their exceptional rarity justifies the premium compensation they receive.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 24741,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2597,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, I am convinced that doctors, nurses and teachers make far more significant contributions that warrant higher salaries.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">To begin with, the most compelling argument is that medical professionals directly save lives and prevent diseases on a daily basis. Their work prevents the loss of human life, and this contribution is irreplaceable and fundamental to society, as no amount of entertainment can substitute for health and survival.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, teachers play an equally vital role by educating young people who will become the future workforce and leaders. To be more specific, the quality of education they provide determines society's progress and development, and without teachers, no other professions, including medicine and entertainment, would exist in the first place.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 24741,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2598,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, while sports and entertainment figures face unique challenges such as short careers and intense competition, I believe doctors, nurses and teachers deserve higher compensation given their irreplaceable roles in preserving life and shaping future generations.</p>",
